# Copy to .env.local for local development.
# None of these are required to run the /world vertical slice — Zayra falls
# back to a scripted mock adapter when no key is present (see
# apps/web/lib/zayra/adapter.ts). No secret in this file is ever sent to the
# browser; it is only read from server route handlers.

# Optional: enables the real Zayra LLM adapter instead of the mock.
# ZAYRA_MODEL_API_KEY=
